    "cpsHistoryClearance": "<p>431024057&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>KING&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ELYSSA&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;P</strong> 05 23 2001 F&nbsp;C 213 61 8552</p><p>As of 2/19/21 CIS has address of 221 Gold St., Salisbury, MD 21804 &amp; phone 443 855 3231</p><p>Only self listed for FS Case list</p><p>Negative CPS hx</p><p>Listed under Holly Carson service cases #<span style=\"color: windowtext;\">3244233</span></p><p>Negative MD Judiciary &amp; Ntl. SOR.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>446018229&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>MAAG&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CHRISTOPHER&nbsp;L</strong> 10 24 1998 M&nbsp;P 217 53 3337</p><p>As of 6/1/21 CIS has address of 221 Gold St., Salisbury, MD 21804 &amp; phone 443 397 2634</p><p>Negative FS case list</p><p>Maltreator AR neglect in Jan. 2019</p><p>Victim unsub neglect in Dec. 2007.</p><p>Listed under Angela Arecement #<span style=\"color: windowtext;\">3012037</span> &amp; Shirley Carter #<span style=\"color: windowtext;\">3155450</span></p><p>Negative MD Judiciary &amp; Ntl. SOR.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Jan. 2019 (#<span style=\"color: windowtext;\">CW2925553</span>) - The family came to the attention of the agency through an afterhours report from Peninsula Regional Medical Center. Ms. Arcement brought child, Ma Kayla, to the hospital with concerns that she was tired, lethargic, crying on and off, and overall, not acting like herself. The hospital ran tests and Ma Kayla tested positive for THC (marijuana).</p><p><br></p><p>Dec. 2007 (#<span style=\"color: windowtext;\">CW2369486</span>) – no narrative</p>",
